   "description": "Internal - not part of the original field list. A stable identifier for this row that Weaving Receipt Details rows use to reference it, set once when the row is created. Needed because a child row's own `name` is only a temporary client-side value until the document is first saved, then gets replaced with a permanent one - matching Details back to their Items row by `name` would silently break the moment the document is saved. `row_key` never changes, so the match keeps working before and after save."
